<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Read List - Início</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background: #f6f7fb; margin: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 60px auto; padding: 24px; text-align: center; }
    .card { background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06); }
    a.btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 16px; background: #2563eb; color: white; padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; }
    a.btn:hover { background: #1e40af; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <h1>Lista de Leituras (MVC)</h1>
      <p>Gerencie os livros que você pretende ler.</p>
      <a href="/livros" class="btn">Ir para a lista de livros</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>